                                "sense_id": "7794f0a5-0e8b-3600-ad99-0421ea393c1e",
                                "text": "We didn't al'ays stay here, but wair on the wing here and thar where game was most plentiful, and often in company with the Mingoes, who wair our sworn fri'nds an' allies."
